nzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Maka mereka mendustakannya, karena itu mereka akan diseret (ke neraka),", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "فَكَذَّبُوهُ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/d4d68120888dc9a98f5d.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "so they denied him", "bs": "pa su ga poricali", "tr": "böylece onu inkar ettiler", "fr": "alors ils l'ont nié", "id": "maka mereka telah mendustakannya", "ur": "پس انہوں نے اسے جھٹلایا", "bn": "অতঃপর তারা তাকে অস্বীকার করেছে", "fa": "پس او را تکذیب کردند"}}, {"text": "فَإِنَّهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَمُحْضَرُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "55:13", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antuma", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4914.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Which is it, of the favours of your Lord, that ye deny?", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Şimdi Rabbinizin hangi nimetlerini yalanlıyorsunuz?", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تو اے جن و انس! تم دونوں اپنے رب کی کون سی نعمت کو جھٹلاؤ گے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Maka nikmat Tuhan kamu yang manakah yang kamu dustakan?", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "فَبِأَىِّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ءَالَآءِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "رَبِّكُمَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تُكَذِّبَانِ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/b4deaba3c709c5a0a8b5.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "poričete (vas dvoje)", "en": "you two deny", "tr": "ikiniz yalanlarsınız", "fr": "niez-vous tous deux", "id": "kamu berdua dustakan", "ur": "تم دونوں جھٹلاؤ گے", "bn": "তোমরা দুজন অস্বীকার কর", "fa": "(شما دو) تکذیب می‌کنید"}}]}, {"ref": "75:32", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5583.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "But he denied and flouted.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Fakat yalanladı ve döndü.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "ہاں جھٹلایا اور منہ پھیرا", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "tetapi ia mendustakan (Rasul) dam berpaling (dari kebenaran),", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَلَٰكِن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كَذَّبَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/a001602d5b2a43c37995.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "he/it denied", "bs": "poricao je", "tr": "inkar etti", "fr": "il a nié", "id": "dia telah mendustakan", "ur": "اُس نے جھٹلایا", "bn": "সে অস্বীকার করেছে", "fa": "تکذیب کرد"}}, {"text": "وَتَوَلَّىٰ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "26:123", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hiya", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/3055.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "(The tribe of) A'ad denied the messengers (of Allah).", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Âd (kavmi) de peygamberleri yalancılıkla itham etti.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "عاد نے رسولوں کو جھٹلایا", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Kaum 'Aad telah mendustakan para rasul.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "كَذَّبَتْ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/60090bb9e4e6062f9881.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "utjerao je u laž", "en": "denied", "tr": "yalanladı", "fr": "traita de menteurs", "id": "telah mendustakan", "ur": "جھٹلایا", "bn": "অস্বীকার করেছিল", "fa": "تکذیب کرد"}}, {"text": "عَادٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "56:82", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5061.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And make denial thereof your livelihood?", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Rızkınızı, yalanlamanızdan ibaret mi kılıyorsunuz?", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور اپنا حصہ یہ رکھتے ہو کہ جھٹلاتے ہو", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "kamu mengganti rezeki (yang Allah berikan) dengan mendustakan Allah.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَتَجْعَلُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "رِزْقَكُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَنَّكُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تُكَذِّبُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/ded455e781551f703336.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "you (all) deny", "bs": "poričete", "tr": "inkar edersiniz", "fr": "vous niez", "id": "kalian mendustakan", "ur": "تم سب جھٹلاتے ہو", "bn": "তোমরা অস্বীকার কর", "fa": "تکذیب می‌کنید"}}]}, {"ref": "83:11", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5859.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Those who deny the Day of Judgment", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Onlar ceza gününü yalanlayanlardır.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "جو انصاف کے دن کو جھٹلاتے ہیں", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "(yaitu) orang-orang yang mendustakan hari pembalasan.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يُكَذِّبُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/fe7b53ab858e71a29064.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "they deny", "bs"